title: Streetfighting
new-page: true
is-card: true
on-arrival: streetfighting_timer = 6; month_actions += 1; rb_militarization_cost = 2 if rb_militancy > 0.1 else rb_militarization_cost = 1; rb_militarization_cost = 3 if rb_militancy > 0.25; strife += 1
view-if: year >= 1930 and sa_strength >= 150 and streetfighting_timer == 0 and not return_to_normalcy
card-image: img/kcp_streetfighting.png
tags: party_affairs; antifascism

= Streetfighting

Battles rage on the streets between the regionalists , various anti-establishment forces and our own forces. In some parts of the country, conditions are nearing a boiling point.

# - @battle: Test our defense units in battle against the forces which seek to destroy the republic!
- @arm_rb: Arm the Black Militia
- @if_training: Train as part of a united front together with our trade unions.
- @peace: Try to avoid all militant confrontations, as much as possible.
- @easy_discard

@battle
view-if: rb_militancy > 0.1 and rb_militancy < 0.5
on-arrival: rb_militancy += 0.1; sa_strength += 40; rb_strength -= 100; 

The Black Militia hasnt been used to fight for years and some members leave after the brawl is over but those who stay are tougher as a result. This also however makes the opposition strenghten their own forces.

@arm_rb
subtitle: -[+ rb_militarization_cost +] resource
choose-if: resources >= rb_militarization_cost
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources ([+ rb_militarization_cost +] needed).
on-arrival: resources -= rb_militarization_cost; rb_militancy += 0.06; rb_strength += 50; sa_strength += 50; z_relation -= 5 if historical_mode 

We have increased training and purchased more armaments for the Black Militia.

@if_training
on-arrival: rb_militancy += 0.03; rb_strength += 200; sa_strength += 50; 
max-visits: 2

As part of a united front against the forces tearing our country apart we are increasing training and coordination.

@peace
on-arrival: rb_militancy -= 0.02; rb_strength -= 50; pacifism += 1; sa_strenght -=200 ; strife -= 1

By not fighting, the strength of the Black Militia atrophies however some are noticing a improvement of the situation on the ground as less clashes do not justify a paramilitary buildup.

